{"id":"n58107-1-7","stage":1,"title":"쇼핑 · 购物","scene":"工作与经济","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n58107-1-7-1","ko":"주로 어디에서 옷을 사세요?","zh":"您通常在哪儿买衣服呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"주로","meaning":"主要","explanation":"주로：主要","readings":[{"term":"주로","audio":"/audio/082e27671571beef0683.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91767","senseId":"1","lemma":"주로","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어디에서","meaning":"哪里，哪儿","explanation":"어디：哪里，哪儿；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"어디","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60319","senseId":"1","lemma":"어디","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"옷을","meaning":"衣服，衣裳，服装","explanation":"옷：衣服，衣裳，服装；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"옷","audio":"/audio/4bddf9b9203384c7b240.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30159","senseId":"1","lemma":"옷","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"사세요?","meaning":"买，购买","explanation":"사다：买，购买；세요：包含尊敬形式的礼貌句末，可表示请求、劝告或询问等。","readings":[{"term":"사다","audio":"/audio/ee0ee072926e06fcb4a4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"49419","senseId":"1","lemma":"사다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"082e27671571beef","term":"주로","zh":"主要","audio":"/audio/082e27671571beef0683.mp3","entryId":"91767","definition":"成为基本或重心地。","pronunciation":["주로"]},{"id":"c1ee1b7e560f9f3a","term":"어디","zh":"哪里，哪儿","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3","entryId":"60319","definition":"指代不知道的处所。","pronunciation":["어디"]},{"id":"4bddf9b9203384c7","term":"옷","zh":"衣服，衣裳，服装","audio":"/audio/4bddf9b9203384c7b240.mp3","entryId":"30159","definition":"为遮掩身体、防晒抗寒以及追求美观而穿的遮挡物。","pronunciation":["옫"]},{"id":"ee0ee072926e06fc","term":"사다","zh":"买，购买","audio":"/audio/ee0ee072926e06fcb4a4.mp3","entryId":"49419","definition":"用钱使某种东西或权利为己所有。","pronunciation":["사다"]}],"audio":"/audio/a340cced505dbbb45a21.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n58107-1-7-2","ko":"저는 쇼핑을 즐기는 편이 아니라서 자주 가는 매장이 하나밖에 없어요.","zh":"我不太喜欢购物，所以只有常去的一家店而已。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"저는","meaning":"我","explanation":"저：我；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44506","senseId":"1","lemma":"저","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"쇼핑을","meaning":"购物","explanation":"쇼핑：购物；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"쇼핑","audio":"/audio/32a686e2d5809ce01f08.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58107","senseId":"1","lemma":"쇼핑","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"즐기는","meaning":"享受","explanation":"즐기다：享受；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"즐기다","audio":"/audio/52a5578b574f2755fc41.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91878","senseId":"1","lemma":"즐기다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"편이","meaning":"算是","explanation":"편：算是；이：用在 아니다、되다 等前，标记否定或变化涉及的身份、状态。","readings":[{"term":"편","audio":"/audio/53cb600fa1af07485c60.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71321","senseId":"3","lemma":"편","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"아니라서","meaning":"아니다：表示“不是”的否定判断。；라서：名词判断或 아니다 后的原因表达：“因为是、因为不是”。","explanation":"아니다：表示“不是”的否定判断。；라서：名词判断或 아니다 后的原因表达：“因为是、因为不是”。","readings":[{"term":"아니라서","audio":"/audio/aa4bf54182845989341e.mp3"}],"sources":[]},{"text":"자주","meaning":"常常，经常","explanation":"자주：常常，经常","readings":[{"term":"자주","audio":"/audio/604b383d216f9452c5d2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71199","senseId":"1","lemma":"자주","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"가는","meaning":"去","explanation":"가다：去；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"14","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"매장이","meaning":"卖场，商场","explanation":"매장：卖场，商场；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"매장","audio":"/audio/c396dd563fe12c6bb9e6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15929","senseId":"1","lemma":"매장","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"하나밖에","meaning":"唯一","explanation":"하나：唯一；밖에：与否定表达合用，表示“只有、除……之外没有”。","readings":[{"term":"하나","audio":"/audio/556dcbf069a950eb94f3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20283","senseId":"3","lemma":"하나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"없어요.","meaning":"没有","explanation":"없다：没有；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"없다","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89917","senseId":"1","lemma":"없다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"ac0e9ef613fd92c8","term":"저","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3","entryId":"44506","definition":"说话人在听话人面前对自己的谦称。","pronunciation":["저"]},{"id":"32a686e2d5809ce0","term":"쇼핑","zh":"购物","audio":"/audio/32a686e2d5809ce01f08.mp3","entryId":"58107","definition":"逛百货或商店，看并购买东西。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"52a5578b574f2755","term":"즐기다","zh":"享受","audio":"/audio/52a5578b574f2755fc41.mp3","entryId":"91878","definition":"愉快地尽情感受。","pronunciation":["즐기다"]},{"id":"53cb600fa1af0748","term":"편","zh":"算是","audio":"/audio/53cb600fa1af07485c60.mp3","entryId":"71321","definition":"大概属于某一类。","pronunciation":["편"]},{"id":"604b383d216f9452","term":"자주","zh":"常常，经常","audio":"/audio/604b383d216f9452c5d2.mp3","entryId":"71199","definition":"重复做同样事情的间隔短暂地。","pronunciation":["자주"]},{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가다","zh":"去","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3","entryId":"27500","definition":"为做某事而向别的地方移动。","pronunciation":["가다"]},{"id":"c396dd563fe12c6b","term":"매장","zh":"卖场，商场","audio":"/audio/c396dd563fe12c6bb9e6.mp3","entryId":"15929","definition":"出售东西的场所。","pronunciation":["매ː장"]},{"id":"556dcbf069a950eb","term":"하나","zh":"唯一","audio":"/audio/556dcbf069a950eb94f3.mp3","entryId":"20283","definition":"表示唯一，“仅此一个”。","pronunciation":["하나"]},{"id":"815560dcd5b82893","term":"없다","zh":"没有","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3","entryId":"89917","definition":"人或事物等实际上不存在。","pronunciation":["업ː따"]}],"audio":"/audio/37c361861badc56765ea.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.885,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.g